<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link><description>India News Today: Get latest India news and breaking news from India on Times of India. TOI brings the top news headlines from India on Politics, Elections, Current Affairs and more</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-10-08T22:46:29+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/-2128936835.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Thu, 08 Oct 2026 22:46:29 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link></image><item><title><![CDATA['Contest UP polls from Ayodhya': Akhilesh Yadav dares CM Yogi Adityanath]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/contest-up-polls-from-ayodhya-akhilesh-yadav-dares-cm-yogi-adityanath/articleshow/134796086.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134796086.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Akhilesh Yadav has urged Chief Minister Yogi Adityanath to contest the upcoming assembly elections from Ayodhya. He indicated plans to visit the Ram temple alongside SP leaders after visiting Kedareshwar Dham in Etawah. Yadav also noted that the BJP has been conducting surveys for the Ayodhya seat, claiming they are struggling to find a candidate to challenge him. This statement responds to BJP allegations about his temple visitations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/contest-up-polls-from-ayodhya-akhilesh-yadav-dares-cm-yogi-adityanath/articleshow/134796086.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/contest-up-polls-from-ayodhya-akhilesh-yadav-dares-cm-yogi-adityanath/articleshow/134796086.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T22:24:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pallavi</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134796144,imgsize-1455160.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian students make extraordinary contributions to our campus, says Indian American President of University of Arizona Suresh Garimella]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-students-make-extraordinary-contributions-to-our-campus-says-indian-american-president-of-university-of-arizona-suresh-garimella/articleshow/134795762.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134795762.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-students-make-extraordinary-contributions-to-our-campus-says-indian-american-president-of-university-of-arizona-suresh-garimella/articleshow/134795762.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-students-make-extraordinary-contributions-to-our-campus-says-indian-american-president-of-university-of-arizona-suresh-garimella/articleshow/134795762.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T22:13:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ishani Duttagupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134795983,imgsize-77870.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Increase in crime due to SC's forgiving nature: Top court judge]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/indi